{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117042","id":3350717741,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Ht-Ut","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117042","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117042.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117042.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117042","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117042/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117042/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117042/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e78c8b019ef81d227b42ac2e7c084c4fe5157505","number":117042,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix script editor export drop modifier drop line","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95914\r\n- related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109448\r\n\r\nDropping nodes, files, or resources with export drop modifier now puts them onto a new line instead of in the middle of a line.\r\n\r\nDropping multiple files with export drop modifier now puts each of them on a new line instead of being comma-separated if not on empty line. \r\nThis does not apply to the preload modifier, since that can be used within a line (like when making an array).\r\n\r\nDropping nodes with either the member modifier or export modifier now put it on a new line if the line was indented, even if it was otherwise empty.\r\nThis is because they don't work when they are indented. If you dropped into a function, it will still have errors but at the end of a function is now fine.\r\n\r\nDropping on empty line behavior is now unified, the empty line will be preserved when dropping anything on an empty line. So it now includes properties and nodes without modifiers (and nodes with export modifier), everything else already does it.\r\nThis fixes dropping a resource not indenting its new empty line to match the current indentation.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":470